[
  {
    "id": "q001",
    "content": "先写一行，今天就不算白过。",
    "contentEn": "One line down — today already counts.",
    "author": "瞬记",
    "category": "mindfulness",
    "targetMoods": ["焦虑", "紧张", "疲惫"],
    "timeContext": "morning",
    "weight": 1.3,
    "createdAt": "2026-02-01T00:00:00Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "q002",
    "content": "把情绪倒出来，心里会轻很多。",
    "contentEn": "Get it out. You'll feel lighter.",
    "author": "瞬记",
    "category": "selfCompassion",
    "targetMoods": ["低落", "烦躁", "委屈"],
    "timeContext": "anytime",
    "weight": 1.3,
    "createdAt": "2026-02-02T00:00:00Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "q003",
    "content": "你肯写下来，已经很棒了。",
    "contentEn": "You wrote it down. That's enough.",
    "author": "瞬记",
    "category": "selfCompassion",
    "targetMoods": ["自责", "内疚", "沮丧"],
    "timeContext": "anytime",
    "weight": 1.4,
    "createdAt": "2026-02-03T00:00:00Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "q004",
    "content": "先记发生了啥，再记心里咋了。",
    "contentEn": "First, what happened. Then, how it felt.",
    "author": "瞬记",
    "category": "nvc",
    "targetMoods": ["混乱", "冲突", "压抑"],
    "timeContext": "afternoon",
    "weight": 1.2,
    "createdAt": "2026-02-04T00:00:00Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "q005",
    "content": "哪怕一句，也是在照顾自己。",
    "contentEn": "Even one line counts. That's taking care of yourself.",
    "author": "瞬记",
    "category": "stoicism",
    "targetMoods": ["无力", "空虚", "疲惫"],
    "timeContext": "evening",
    "weight": 1.3,
    "createdAt": "2026-02-05T00:00:00Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "q006",
    "content": "今天不卷完美，先做真实的你。",
    "contentEn": "Not perfect today. Just real.",
    "author": "瞬记",
    "category": "mindfulness",
    "targetMoods": ["压力", "焦虑", "完美主义"],
    "timeContext": "morning",
    "weight": 1.2,
    "createdAt": "2026-02-06T00:00:00Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "q007",
    "content": "你现在的感受，值得被认真对待。",
    "contentEn": "What you're feeling right now — it matters.",
    "author": "瞬记",
    "category": "mindfulness",
    "targetMoods": ["不安", "羞愧", "自我怀疑"],
    "timeContext": "anytime",
    "weight": 1.4,
    "createdAt": "2026-02-07T00:00:00Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "q008",
    "content": "先缓口气，再写下此刻。",
    "contentEn": "Catch your breath first. Then write.",
    "author": "瞬记",
    "category": "mindfulness",
    "targetMoods": ["紧张", "烦躁", "愤怒"],
    "timeContext": "anytime",
    "weight": 1.2,
    "createdAt": "2026-02-08T00:00:00Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "q009",
    "content": "敢面对自己，本身就很酷。",
    "contentEn": "Turning toward yourself takes guts.",
    "author": "瞬记",
    "category": "selfCompassion",
    "targetMoods": ["迷茫", "失落", "无助"],
    "timeContext": "evening",
    "weight": 1.3,
    "createdAt": "2026-02-09T00:00:00Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "q010",
    "content": "把担心写出来，它就没那么吓人。",
    "contentEn": "Write down what worries you. It shrinks on paper.",
    "author": "瞬记",
    "category": "stoicism",
    "targetMoods": ["担心", "焦虑", "压力"],
    "timeContext": "afternoon",
    "weight": 1.2,
    "createdAt": "2026-02-10T00:00:00Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "q011",
    "content": "先写三个词，状态就会回来。",
    "contentEn": "Just three words. Your head will clear.",
    "author": "瞬记",
    "category": "mindfulness",
    "targetMoods": ["拖延", "无力", "疲惫"],
    "timeContext": "anytime",
    "weight": 1.3,
    "createdAt": "2026-02-11T00:00:00Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "q012",
    "content": "别急着苛责自己，先抱抱自己。",
    "contentEn": "Slow down on the blame. Be kind to yourself first.",
    "author": "瞬记",
    "category": "selfCompassion",
    "targetMoods": ["难过", "内疚", "自责"],
    "timeContext": "evening",
    "weight": 1.4,
    "createdAt": "2026-02-12T00:00:00Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "q013",
    "content": "先记下来，答案会慢慢浮出来。",
    "contentEn": "Write it down. The answer will surface on its own.",
    "author": "瞬记",
    "category": "nvc",
    "targetMoods": ["困惑", "压抑", "冲突"],
    "timeContext": "afternoon",
    "weight": 1.2,
    "createdAt": "2026-02-13T00:00:00Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "q014",
    "content": "今天没垮掉，就已经赢了。",
    "contentEn": "You didn't fall apart today. That's already a win.",
    "author": "瞬记",
    "category": "stoicism",
    "targetMoods": ["挫败", "低落", "失望"],
    "timeContext": "evening",
    "weight": 1.3,
    "createdAt": "2026-02-14T00:00:00Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "q015",
    "content": "写下这一刻，重新开机。",
    "contentEn": "Write this moment. Hit reset.",
    "author": "瞬记",
    "category": "mindfulness",
    "targetMoods": ["迷茫", "焦虑", "不确定"],
    "timeContext": "morning",
    "weight": 1.3,
    "createdAt": "2026-02-15T00:00:00Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "q016",
    "content": "你的情绪不是麻烦，是信号。",
    "contentEn": "Your emotions aren't a problem — they're a signal.",
    "author": "瞬记",
    "category": "selfCompassion",
    "targetMoods": ["孤独", "委屈", "被忽视"],
    "timeContext": "anytime",
    "weight": 1.4,
    "createdAt": "2026-02-16T00:00:00Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "q017",
    "content": "想说啥先写这儿，别憋着。",
    "contentEn": "Say it here first. No holding back.",
    "author": "瞬记",
    "category": "nvc",
    "targetMoods": ["压抑", "委屈", "愤怒"],
    "timeContext": "evening",
    "weight": 1.2,
    "createdAt": "2026-02-17T00:00:00Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "q018",
    "content": "慢一点没事，你已经在变好了。",
    "contentEn": "No rush. You're already on your way.",
    "author": "瞬记",
    "category": "stoicism",
    "targetMoods": ["自我怀疑", "焦虑", "紧张"],
    "timeContext": "morning",
    "weight": 1.3,
    "createdAt": "2026-02-18T00:00:00Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "q019",
    "content": "记录一下，脑子会清爽不少。",
    "contentEn": "Get it on paper. Your mind will breathe again.",
    "author": "瞬记",
    "category": "mindfulness",
    "targetMoods": ["压力", "烦躁", "疲惫"],
    "timeContext": "anytime",
    "weight": 1.3,
    "createdAt": "2026-02-19T00:00:00Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "q020",
    "content": "今天的你，已经值得被夸奖。",
    "contentEn": "You showed up today. That counts.",
    "author": "瞬记",
    "category": "selfCompassion",
    "targetMoods": ["无力", "低落", "疲惫"],
    "timeContext": "evening",
    "weight": 1.4,
